Error [E0027]: lists use `push`, not `append`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_append.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     append(xs);
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: add an item to the end of a list with `.push(value)`
 Fix: e.g. `items.push(x)`

Error [E0003]: expected a value, found `;`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_append.jet:3:15
    |
  3 |     append(xs);
    |               ^
 Why: a value can be a name, a number, quoted text, `true`/`false`, or a call
 Fix: e.g. `x`, `42`, `3.5`, or `"hello"`
